# A headless display for the in-guest `screenshot` tool (DESIGN-BOXES 2(g)):
# chromium for url mode, Xvfb + scrot (and Pillow for the downscale) for app
# mode. About +450 MB. chromium peaks at 300-500 MB, hence the memory floor:
# on a 4 GB host the RAM budget then keeps it from running beside another
# large box.
name desktop
from main
min_mem_mb 1280

apt xvfb chromium fonts-dejavu-core scrot matchbox-window-manager
apt python3-pil
